190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (Hello everyone, and a special welcome to our instructor, Eng. Hagar. Have you ever wondered how retail businesses generate millions in sales, yet still end up losing money? We asked ourselves this exact question. My name is Mohamed Khalid, and with my talented team of Ahmed, Mariem, and Youssef, we are excited to present our final project: the Sales Data Analysis and Profit Prediction App. In this project, we didn't just look at past sales; we built a complete pipeline to forecast profitability.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
